Subject: [PATCH 32/47] ARM: dts: r8a7745: Add VSP support
Date: Fri, 16 Mar 2018 17:38:29 +0100
Message-Id: <76a2577d97f0b221245e56a17a70bb10a3a97419.1521218085.git.horms+renesas@verge.net.au>
